      "summary": "Builds on Jaren 0.219.0, whose `$date-format` writes a date on a named time zone's wall clock through an injected zone provider and whose clock arithmetic cuts a sub-millisecond fraction instead of rounding it. Tangle uses none of the date operators, so no behaviour changes; the pins, the foundation manifest and the integration audit move to the new release.",
      "id": "jaren-0-219"
    }
